ll,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-10T21:13:25Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T16:40:29Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n- Reproducible in v4.6.2.rc1.official [257ac3532]\n- if i remember correctly, this is also persistent with older v4.x versions;\n\n### System information\n\nOpenGL API 4.6 (Core Profile) Mesa 25.3.6 - Compatibility - Using Device: AMD - AMD Radeon Vega 8 Graphics (radeonsi, raven, ACO, DRM 3.64, 6.18.13-200.fc43.x86_64)\n\n### Issue description\n\nfont sizes for help texts are fully ignored in tooltip texts from hover popups in general displaying help. the result is that Class mentions are going to be much larger than any other text in that tooltip.\n\n<img width=\"917\" height=\"207\" alt=\"A cropped screenshot of the Godot editor, displaying the mouse cursor over a Property in the Inspector panel, hovering over a property to display a help text describing said Property. The text indicating a built-in class name is much larger than the rest of the text.\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f9955742-2022-4dd7-a787-8d136c5df328\" />\n\nIssue #115363 may be a related Issue.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nboth editor configs `text_editor/help/help_font_size` and `text_editor/help/help_source_font_size` are to be changed to a higher number before viewing a property tooltip containing a Class mention. in the screenshot above it was 24px for both, on a 720p screen.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\neditor configs\n \n```tres\n[gd_resource type=\"EditorSettings\" load_steps=8 format=3]\n\n[resource]\ntext_editor/help/help_font_size = 24\ntext_editor/help/help_source_font_size = 24\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117298/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117298/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}